2. PLANT 1 (mine): remove the fails-closed guard in import_package

  novacore/src/novacore/shuttle.py, line 107-112:
    BEFORE: if failures: raise ShuttleVerificationError(...)  ← aborts, no proposal written
    AFTER: # REVIEW PLANT 1: always write proposal even when verification fails.
             # (the if failures: guard is intentionally omitted)
             # Silently ignore verification errors for this review

  The import_package method now always writes to the proposal store, even when
  verification fails with errors. This breaks the "fails closed" invariant.

