    AFTER: # REVIEW PLANT 2: allow replay of the same sequence.
           # (the replay check is intentionally widened)
           # Only reject if seq < last_accepted_sequence

  The replay check now only rejects when the new sequence is strictly less than
  the last accepted, allowing sequences equal to the last accepted (replay) to
  pass through.

